      "sha": "c9dc4353e00e334a995dbe5f41a0f295e9ea5c75",
      "message": "feat: add discarded_storage_read lint for unused storage gets\n\nDetects get() calls on Instance/Persistent/Temporary storage whose\nresult is discarded (statement expression) or bound to wildcard (_).\n\nDoes not fire on has() checks or reads used in subsequent expressions.\nSuggests has() as a cheaper alternative for existence checks.\n\nCovers #116.",
